Shadows the upstream resource of the same name: the app-install promo art
(a logo on a circular plate, drawn at about 31dp). The plate keeps
upstream's framework white — no literal colour value may live under
branding/ while the palette is [Open (OD-071)] — and the mark is the same
generated app_icon bitmap the launcher shows, inset so it sits inside the
plate.
-->
<layer-list xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android">
    <item>
        <shape android:shape="oval">
            <solid android:color="@android:color/white" />
        </shape>
    </item>
    <item
        android:top="4dp"
        android:bottom="4dp"
        android:left="4dp"
        android:right="4dp"
        android:drawable="@mipmap/app_icon" />
</layer-list>
